00:04:12.712 --> 00:04:15.535
what's your overall bit of
advice on how to turn ideas

00:04:15.535 --> 00:04:17.085
into reality for entrepreneurs?

00:04:17.085 --> 00:04:20.441
- Yeah, I think actually an
amazing, not related to this,

00:04:20.441 --> 00:04:24.620
but an amazing guy,
Martin Luther King said,

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.375
to climb that giant staircase,

00:04:26.375 --> 00:04:28.222
you got to just take the first step.

00:04:28.222 --> 00:04:32.756
And I think the golden rule
is if you have conviction,

00:04:32.756 --> 00:04:36.968
you have belief, you have
an idea, then it's all about

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:38.816
down to you to make it happen.

00:04:38.816 --> 00:04:43.701
And it is so easy to just worry
about stuff or think about

00:04:43.701 --> 00:04:45.915
the reasons why you can't do it.

00:04:45.915 --> 00:04:49.315
And I think for entrepreneurs,
that's leap, you know,

00:04:49.315 --> 00:04:51.607
we all periods of
self-doubt, let's be honest.

00:04:51.607 --> 00:04:54.221
But you've to have, you got
to clear those cobwebs away

00:04:54.221 --> 00:04:55.777
and say, alright, I'm going to do it

00:04:55.777 --> 00:04:57.454
and I'm going to absolutely do it.

00:04:57.454 --> 00:05:00.114
And within Sage, I say to
all my colleagues, I say,

00:05:00.114 --> 00:05:01.377
guys let's just do it.

00:05:01.377 --> 00:05:02.405
If it's right for the customer,

00:05:02.405 --> 00:05:04.487
walk in the shoes of the customer.

00:05:04.487 --> 00:05:07.310
I keep an empty chair in every
meeting for the customer.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:09.483
If it's the right thing to
do, then just go for it.

00:05:09.483 --> 00:05:11.492
I'll give you 100% air cover.

00:05:11.492 --> 00:05:14.764
And I far prefer you
fail fast, fail quick,

00:05:14.764 --> 00:05:18.126
and then find the idea that
really meets the customer needs.

00:05:18.126 --> 00:05:20.214
Then just think about
it in that kind of old

00:05:20.214 --> 00:05:22.833
analysis paralysis, which kills companies,

00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:24.107
kills entrepreneurs.

00:05:24.107 --> 00:05:25.462
- I love it.

00:05:25.462 --> 00:05:28.122
So guys, leave your
questions in the Comments.

00:05:28.122 --> 00:05:29.147
