00:09:14.067 --> 00:09:16.972
What he said is he never, never, kind of,

00:09:16.972 --> 00:09:18.771
he never runs to where the puck is,

00:09:18.771 --> 00:09:21.686
he always runs to where it's going to be.

00:09:21.686 --> 00:09:25.853
And I think we get inspired by
entrepreneurs who have ideas

00:09:26.915 --> 00:09:29.948
about inventing the future, inventing,

00:09:29.948 --> 00:09:32.361
taking customers on a journey
where the customer might not

00:09:32.361 --> 00:09:36.197
